 that are way more flexible than your average human hands, the creatures can use them to evade enemy attacks or contort for similar purposes.)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920143116-03'00')/NM(6edbcaad-02f8-4407-b328-eb9029cc11c7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Extraflexible Joints - With articulations that are way more flexible than your average human hands, the creatures can use them to evade enemy attacks or contort for similar purposes.</p></body>)/Rect[182.02 537.373 517.586 619.383]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj101 0 obj<</BS 112 0 R/Contents(Demoralize - Beyond the techniques, the creatures adapted some human customs, being able to demoralize enemies using obscene gestures or stunning them with a barrage of finger snapping up to 15 decibels above the recommended to keep auricular health.)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920142930-03'00')/NM(1bb33d7a-66b3-49f9-91f7-b5ae6f243506)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Demoralize - Beyond the techniques, the creatures adapted some human customs, being able to demoralize enemies using obscene gestures or stunning them with a barrage of finger snapping up to 15 dec\ibels above the recommended to ke